<section class="section"><div class="container content-grid"><div><h2>A simpler way to see the bigger picture.</h2><p>SmartCubeMobile is focused on giving users a clear, practical view of their financial information. Instead of making people work through disconnected information, the goal is to put useful data into a consistent and understandable experience.</p><p>We believe technology should make financial information easier to work with—not more complicated.</p><div style="margin-top:30px"><video class="about-video" controls style="max-width:100%;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)"><source src="~/videos/SmartSwitch_Overview_Feb_2015.mp4" type="video/mp4">Your browser does not support HTML5 video.</video></div></div><div class="quote-card"><span>“</span><h3>Clarity creates confidence.</h3><p>Our approach is simple: make important information easier to access, understand and use.</p></div></div></section>
